{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_009_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b5333cf3d31737bfd932496da1af674c322862bfc7940aa4adf99127e17a7e80",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea5c183d9acb5e67be6521866cb24b90e35aabd54136431ff406e97b4d5ed4d5",
      "text": "嗯？怎么了，●●●●プロデューサー。这个巧克力……是给我的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2cb0ae28f925162b2f720234c80419508e842b2d45c08156cf22a73fa518a0b",
      "text": "说起来今天是情人节啊。我忘得一干二净了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f2f80280ca88158bc6958f8a922e0e99d54081238683a44c82fc290bf58a1fc",
      "text": "准备这个很费劲吧？毕竟你平时看起来总是那么忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5bd79331257f4e19fe65b9d569eed2f637b81fc06c56f2b09658b8500a46a55",
      "text": "巧克力，谢啦。我回头再吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79e51e63f7203eb73c137989743c9e9e7521be2b1bec42063c8dceab3d3bb481",
      "text": "那么，我接下来还有训练课。回头见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:207bf0cbab44277f5e6ea837aa6dbb38a3569d2dd0e0025ae8175a4272897307",
      "text": "情人节巧克力？这样啊，都已经到这个时候了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4397244449111e4e1afdebd6e0a16da8ce2ae3198b563882c2acfcc7ddbbdd78",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8545311d43634f1465c3fe80fe3ef89ba7f3c4a4f0bd29cfb16b5aef4b5d76b6",
      "text": "……看起来挺好吃的巧克力啊。我就心怀感激地收下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_b:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78e82f9718ed101147ea1c9e3fb5820f1c9906b70562d32919d9810a3cec907a",
      "text": "我在里面注入了PASSION！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_b:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f873428a4914231b30b2ce2ca5e0832af6d223166264d8344aab698183517dfa",
      "text": "您能喜欢太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f26dcef18b36b7e2a42647f5c21e4ef88a4875c06ad37f5b47396a5f92fdc4b7",
      "text": "哈哈。真有制作人的风格。总觉得吃了就能打起精神来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eebd9416a02a22f16c26006b8cbfa217854d7b42f7422b76e64f8f65f3712b47",
      "text": "啊啊，谢啦。我很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb971fdaf64c873abcfb11a2246a09863dffd5370e9a3afe6a5fcfda2032d393",
      "text": "话又说回来，居然还准备了情人节巧克力，你还挺细心周到的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5afca63633c57a871015ec0e478253454ddf979e3cc5239a7001885a13711768",
      "text": "啊啊，不，我没有什么不好的意思。只是觉得不愧是你而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2cf194c742cf688e1adaaec287c2585bdb10a5e30f3b8bfa012efffb32b576c",
      "text": "虽然不知道能不能挑出什么贴心的礼物，不过白色情人节我也会准备点东西的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_22:5_01_009_22_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e4aaa6da281140962a08d06f8b491ae10e5499156985720a09733ff2c77b6b7",
      "text": "你就别抱太大期待地等着吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
